Package: PhysioECG
Title: ECG Analysis Functions for PhysioExperiment Objects
Version: 0.4.2
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yusuke",
           family = "Matsui",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com")
Description: Provides electrocardiography (ECG) analysis functions for
    PhysioExperiment objects. Includes R-peak detection (adaptive Pan-Tompkins),
    RR interval computation, HRV time-domain metrics (SDNN, RMSSD, pNN50),
    HRV frequency-domain analysis (VLF, LF, HF power), nonlinear HRV
    (Poincare, Sample Entropy, DFA), ECG morphology analysis (QRS boundaries,
    QT/QTc intervals), and signal quality assessment with ectopic beat
    correction.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2),
    PhysioCore
Imports:
    SummarizedExperiment,
    S4Vectors,
    stats,
    graphics,
    ggplot2
Suggests:
